     Function ddwwaarrff__aattttrr() returns DW_DLV_OK on success.

     If the debugging information entry descriptor denoted by argument _d_i_e
     does not contain the named attribute, the function returns
     DW_DLV_NO_ENTRY and sets argument _e_r_r.  For other errors, it returns
     DW_DLV_ERROR and sets argument _e_r_r.

